OL,3,GNEWSAAfrican Caribbean centre opens in
OL,4,AOxford
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn African Caribbean centre aiming to
OL,7,Fhighlight the contribution the Windrush
OL,8,Fgeneration made to the Oxford community
OL,9,Fhas launched.
OL,11,FThe Island has opened up in the former
OL,12,FStaples outlet store on Park End Street
OL,13,Ffor a trial run that will include
OL,14,Fexhibitions, talks, music, workshops,
OL,15,Fand performances, tying in with Black
OL,16,FHistory Month.
OL,18,FProject partner Euton Daley said: "I
OL,19,Fpersonally can't wait. It's been a very
OL,20,Flong time in the making."
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
